  "doc.stcNote": [
    "\u26A1 \u672C\u6A21\u677F\u5DF2\u542B\u6700\u5C0F\u7CFB\u7EDF\u7535\u8DEF\uFF08\u7535\u6E90\u5F00\u5173\u3001\u6676\u632F\u3001\u63A5\u5730\u7AEF\u5B50\uFF09\u3002<b>STC \u70E7\u5F55\u6D41\u7A0B</b>\uFF1A\u70B9\u300C\u70E7\u5F55\u8FD0\u884C\u300D\u2192 \u65AD\u5F00\u7535\u6E90\u5F00\u5173 \u2192 \u95ED\u5408\u7535\u6E90\u5F00\u5173\uFF08\u4E0A\u7535\u77AC\u95F4\u81EA\u52A8\u70E7\u5F55\u5E76\u8FD0\u884C\uFF09\u3002",
    '\u26A1 This template already contains the minimal-system circuit (power switch, crystal, ground terminals). <b>STC flash flow</b>: click "Flash & Run" \u2192 open the power switch \u2192 close it again (the program is flashed automatically at power-on and starts running).'
  ],
  "doc.blankTitle": ["\u7A7A\u767D\u5DE5\u7A0B", "Blank Project"],
  "doc.blankBody": [
    '<p>Switch to the "\u{1F50C} Circuit" tab, place parts from the palette, and drag from pin to pin to wire (or double-click). <b>Build the power circuit first</b>: power terminal \u2192 power switch \u2192 MCU VCC (pin 40), ground terminal \u2192 GND (pin 20) \u2014 this enables the real STC flash flow (Flash & Run \u2192 power off \u2192 power on to flash and run).</p><p>Write code, click "Build" or "Load HEX", then "Flash & Run".</p>',
    '<p>Switch to the "\u{1F50C} Circuit" tab, place parts from the palette, and drag from pin to pin to wire (or double-click). <b>Build the power circuit first</b>: power terminal \u2192 power switch \u2192 MCU VCC (pin 40), ground terminal \u2192 GND (pin 20) \u2014 this enables the real STC flash flow (Flash & Run \u2192 power off \u2192 power on to flash and run).</p><p>Write code, click "Build" or "Load HEX", then "Flash & Run".</p>'
  ],
